//!               |                |                 |               |
//!          [In-scale?]     [Stateful?]      [Revoicing]      [Spread/Mirror]
//!               |                |                 |
//!          [Interchange]   [VecDeque]        [Previous]
//! ```
//!
//! # Note Tracking
